Cell["\<\
Contracting one array onto no indices at all gives the trace, on numerical \
and symbolic entries alike:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4fe96394-2096-9746-8540-d89b125acebe"],

Cell["\<\
trace[u_List] := Normal @ ArrayMultiply[{u}, \"pp->\"];
{trace[a], trace[sa]}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"bbb95029-1cf8-4740-a1d9-2cef878e53fa"],

